cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "cmvt: clinical-model-validation-toolkit"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, synthetic-first validation harness for clinical prediction
  models: DeLong AUROC comparison, calibration diagnostics, patient-level
  cluster bootstrap, distribution-shift metrics, decidable data-integrity
  checks, and a validation engine that separates true distribution shift from
  information loss. Ships with negative controls demonstrating what the
  toolkit deliberately does not claim (MAR/MNAR identifiability, composite
  quality scores, values-only leakage detection).
type: software
authors:
